01:05:02.898 --> 01:05:05.898
we can learn that God is in control.

261
01:05:05.898 --> 01:05:08.898
He is Lord over his entire creation...

262
01:05:08.898 --> 01:05:11.898
but he is also Lord over your and my lives...

263
01:05:11.898 --> 01:05:15.898
and that gives me confidence to say now...

264
01:05:15.898 --> 01:05:18.898
I trust God completely.

265
01:05:18.898 --> 01:05:24.898
There is therefore nothing more in my life, and I want to express this as a statement...

266
01:05:24.898 --> 01:05:29.898
there is nothing in my life that I do not entrust to him.

267
01:05:29.898 --> 01:05:33.898
At the same time, that is a continual walk...

268
01:05:33.898 --> 01:05:38.898
so that every time little things happen where the Holy Spirit says...

269
01:05:38.898 --> 01:05:42.898
entrust it to me, give that to me.

270
01:05:42.898 --> 01:05:45.898
And then something creeps up again in my flesh.

271
01:05:45.898 --> 01:05:48.898
And then he says, shall we tackle this today?

272
01:05:48.898 --> 01:05:52.898
And then I think to myself, yes but we learned this last week, I believe.

273
01:05:52.898 --> 01:05:55.898
And then the Holy Spirit says, yes but now it comes up again.

274
01:05:55.898 --> 01:05:57.898
Do you understand what I mean?

275
01:05:57.898 --> 01:06:00.898
And a few weeks ago I told you...

276
01:06:00.898 --> 01:06:04.898
that the Bible is written in a certain pattern...

277
01:06:04.898 --> 01:06:07.898
in which we see God doing his work.

278
01:06:07.898 --> 01:06:11.898
All glory to God, the Father, Creator of heaven and earth.

279
01:06:11.898 --> 01:06:14.898
And humanity is placed in that.

280
01:06:14.898 --> 01:06:17.898
And then you get those furrowed brows...

281
01:06:17.898 --> 01:06:20.898
what David says, whose am I?

282
01:06:20.898 --> 01:06:23.898
A human, that you love me.

283
01:06:23.898 --> 01:06:26.898
And God involves us in His plan.

284
01:06:26.898 --> 01:06:30.898
In His plan, He involves mankind.

285
01:06:30.898 --> 01:06:32.898
On His plan.

286
01:06:32.898 --> 01:06:35.898
How unreliable I am.

287
01:06:35.898 --> 01:06:40.898
I am an unreliable, fickle, impulsive, impatient...

288
01:06:40.898 --> 01:06:43.898
but still a great guy.

289
01:06:44.898 --> 01:06:47.898
Yes, I will not unnecessarily blame myself too much.

290
01:06:48.898 --> 01:06:51.898
I am also very humble.

291
01:06:52.898 --> 01:06:55.898
But He uses me for His plan.

292
01:06:55.898 --> 01:06:57.898
That is wonderful.

293
01:06:57.898 --> 01:07:01.898
Thank you, Lord, that you want to use all these people for your plan.

294
01:07:01.898 --> 01:07:04.898
That you use mankind.

295
01:07:04.898 --> 01:07:07.898
And then we see, but what we see is that...

296
01:07:07.898 --> 01:07:11.898
despite God working out His plan through mankind...

297
01:07:11.898 --> 01:07:13.898
we mess it up every time.

298
01:07:13.898 --> 01:07:14.898
I have explained this.

299
01:07:14.898 --> 01:07:17.898
That is the pattern we see coming back every time...

300
01:07:17.898 --> 01:07:20.898
like a kind of cycle that keeps recurring in the Bible.

301
01:07:20.898 --> 01:07:22.898
God does something amazing.

302
01:07:22.898 --> 01:07:23.898
Humans participate in it.

303
01:07:23.898 --> 01:07:25.898
Humans make a mess of it.

304
01:07:25.898 --> 01:07:26.898
God restores.

305
01:07:26.898 --> 01:07:28.898
God does something wonderful again.

306
01:07:28.898 --> 01:07:30.898
He gives another new chance.

307
01:07:30.898 --> 01:07:31.898
Humans understand it again.

308
01:07:31.898 --> 01:07:33.898
Yes, we are doing well together again.

309
01:07:33.898 --> 01:07:34.898
There is blessing again.

310
01:07:34.898 --> 01:07:36.898
There is protection and guidance again.

311
01:07:36.898 --> 01:07:38.898
And hop, we make a mess of it again.

312
01:07:38.898 --> 01:07:41.898
And then God says, hop, we will do it again.

313
01:07:41.898 --> 01:07:44.898
For I am, God says, I am indeed reliable.

314
01:07:44.898 --> 01:07:45.898
And I restore.

315
01:07:45.898 --> 01:07:47.898
Wow, what a loving God.

316
01:07:47.898 --> 01:07:50.898
And that keeps going on.

317
01:07:50.898 --> 01:07:52.898
That our God does not grow tired of us.

318
01:07:52.898 --> 01:07:53.898
And he does not grow tired of us.

319
01:07:53.898 --> 01:07:54.898
He loves you so much.

320
01:07:54.898 --> 01:07:56.898
That he sent his son into the world.

321
01:07:56.898 --> 01:07:59.898
So that in the name of Jesus we will not perish.

322
01:07:59.898 --> 01:08:01.898
But will receive eternal life.

323
01:08:01.898 --> 01:08:03.898
Let's give a round of applause for King Jesus.

324
01:08:03.898 --> 01:08:06.898
That He continues with us.

325
01:08:06.898 --> 01:08:09.898
That He just keeps going with us.

326
01:08:09.898 --> 01:08:12.898
Wonderful, what a loving God we have.

327
01:08:12.898 --> 01:08:17.898
And today, this morning I want to conclude Ezra.

328
01:08:17.898 --> 01:08:20.898
I actually wanted to cover Ezra and Nehemiah.

329
01:08:20.898 --> 01:08:25.898
But I eventually understood, while we were going through Ezra and Nehemiah.

330
01:08:25.898 --> 01:08:27.898
That I thought, you know what, we will stop at Ezra.

331
01:08:27.898 --> 01:08:29.898
Because we are heading towards Easter soon.

332
01:08:29.898 --> 01:08:32.898
So I will conclude Ezra with Ezra himself.

333
01:08:32.898 --> 01:08:35.898
And today we will do Ezra 9 and 10.

334
01:08:35.898 --> 01:08:37.898
And that is a heavy topic.

335
01:08:37.898 --> 01:08:42.898
Has anyone done their homework by reading Ezekiel?

336
01:08:42.898 --> 01:08:45.898
Tim, couldn't you have given some other homework?

337
01:08:45.898 --> 01:08:49.898
What a heavy topic, right?

338
01:08:49.898 --> 01:08:52.898
Ezekiel 16 is heavy, right?

339
01:08:52.898 --> 01:08:55.898
There is language in there that you don't...

340
01:08:55.898 --> 01:08:58.898
Yes, it is very uncomfortable.

341
01:09:00.898 --> 01:09:06.898
Ezra 9, Ezra 10, the whole Old Testament...

342
01:09:06.898 --> 01:09:11.898
are physical stories of spiritual realities.

343
01:09:11.898 --> 01:09:14.898
If you want to take notes...

344
01:09:14.898 --> 01:09:21.898
The Old Testament is full of physical stories about spiritual realities.

345
01:09:23.898 --> 01:09:26.898
How should I read the Old Testament?

346
01:09:26.898 --> 01:09:30.898
How should I read warfare in the Old Testament?

347
01:09:30.898 --> 01:09:33.898
How should I read provision in the Old Testament?

348
01:09:33.898 --> 01:09:36.898
How should I read sin in the Old Testament?

349
01:09:36.898 --> 01:09:41.898
How should I read the condemnation of God in the Old Testament...

350
01:09:41.898 --> 01:09:44.898
How should I deal with that? How should I read that?

351
01:09:44.898 --> 01:09:52.898
These are all Old Testament, physical examples of spiritual realities.

352
01:09:54.898 --> 01:10:00.898
The spiritual world is more real than the world we see.

353
01:10:03.898 --> 01:10:08.898
I repeat, the spiritual world is more real...

354
01:10:08.898 --> 01:10:11.898
than the natural world we see.

355
01:10:11.898 --> 01:10:17.898
For what we all see is often just a bit of a mirage.

356
01:10:17.898 --> 01:10:21.898
Often we find this, but that is not actually it.

357
01:10:21.898 --> 01:10:28.898
Often we want that, but in the end we do not get what we had wanted from what we desire so much.

358
01:10:28.898 --> 01:10:31.898
So that natural world is also just a...

359
01:10:32.898 --> 01:10:38.898
Yes, I will not say the word matrix, because then we enter a certain way of thinking of a certain group of people.

360
01:10:38.898 --> 01:10:40.898
That is all nonsense.

361
01:10:41.898 --> 01:10:46.898
But the natural world expresses itself in the spiritual world...

362
01:10:46.898 --> 01:10:50.898
but the spiritual world also expresses itself in the natural world.

363
01:10:50.898 --> 01:10:54.898
But God is spirit, and from the spirit God said...

364
01:10:54.898 --> 01:10:56.898
I want there to be light, and there was light.

365
01:10:56.898 --> 01:10:58.898
And I want there to be clouds, and there were clouds.

366
01:10:58.898 --> 01:11:00.898
And I want there to be trees, and there are trees.

367
01:11:00.898 --> 01:11:04.898
So from the spirit, reality came forth.

368
01:11:05.898 --> 01:11:10.898
And when we read the Old Testament, we read all kinds of physical stories...

369
01:11:10.898 --> 01:11:14.898
about all kinds of real people, who all really existed.

370
01:11:14.898 --> 01:11:20.898
And in that we read as believing people, filled with the Holy Spirit...

371
01:11:20.898 --> 01:11:23.898
we read what the spiritual realities are there.

372
01:11:23.898 --> 01:11:25.898
Do you understand what I mean?

373
01:11:26.898 --> 01:11:28.898
Ezra 9 is such a story.

374
01:11:30.898 --> 01:11:33.898
And Israel is such a story.

375
01:11:34.898 --> 01:11:38.898
Israel is a physical example...

376
01:11:39.898 --> 01:11:41.898
of the love of God...

377
01:11:42.898 --> 01:11:44.898
for His son Israel.

378
01:11:44.898 --> 01:11:46.898
And Israel is therefore a physical example.

379
01:11:46.898 --> 01:11:50.898
I don't know how long you have been in open church, but I have done this twice already...

380
01:11:50.898 --> 01:11:52.898
and I am not going to do it a third time, Kiani.

381
01:11:52.898 --> 01:11:55.898
But then I would have brought Kiani forward, and I would have shown...

382
01:11:55.898 --> 01:11:57.898
by placing a person here...

383
01:11:57.898 --> 01:12:00.898
and I would have shown that God said...

384
01:12:00.898 --> 01:12:07.898
how am I going to show my love as Creator to all those people?

385
01:12:07.898 --> 01:12:10.898
You all represent the world, the whole world.

386
01:12:10.898 --> 01:12:14.898
And how am I going to show all people around the world, across all times...

387
01:12:14.898 --> 01:12:18.898
how am I going to show that I am a loving Father Creator?

388
01:12:18.898 --> 01:12:19.898
How am I going to do that?

389
01:12:20.898 --> 01:12:23.898
And then God says, you know what?

390
01:12:23.898 --> 01:12:25.898
I take one man.

391
01:12:25.898 --> 01:12:27.898
I take one man, Abraham.

392
01:12:27.898 --> 01:12:31.898
And I say, Abraham, come. Abraham, come out from where you come from.

393
01:12:31.898 --> 01:12:33.898
Come here, come stand here, Abraham.

394
01:12:33.898 --> 01:12:34.898
Abraham, wow, wow.

395
01:12:35.898 --> 01:12:37.898
Yes, I hear God.

396
01:12:37.898 --> 01:12:41.898
Yes, God, here I am. Abraham, Abraham, follow me.

397
01:12:41.898 --> 01:12:46.898
And I will make you someone different than what you are now.

398
01:12:46.898 --> 01:12:50.898
I will take you out of the whole world where you come from...

399
01:12:50.898 --> 01:12:54.898
and I will begin a relationship with you as Father to son.

400
01:12:54.898 --> 01:12:55.898
I love you, Abraham.

401
01:12:55.898 --> 01:12:58.898
Can you hear me? Yes, I hear you, yes, I hear you.

402
01:12:58.898 --> 01:13:00.898
Yes, wow, wow. I hear you, I hear you.

403
01:13:00.898 --> 01:13:03.898
And God is actually always calling across the whole earth...

404
01:13:03.898 --> 01:13:04.898
Hello people, hello people.

405
01:13:04.898 --> 01:13:08.898
No one hears him and everyone is all busy with themselves.

406
01:13:09.898 --> 01:13:12.898
He calls Abraham and Abraham comes in tune with God.

407
01:13:12.898 --> 01:13:14.898
Look, yes, wow, wow.

408
01:13:14.898 --> 01:13:17.898
Wow, there is a God. Follow me, says God, follow me.

409
01:13:17.898 --> 01:13:19.898
Yes, yes, yes, I must follow God.

410
01:13:19.898 --> 01:13:22.898
And then God says to Abraham, if you trust me...

411
01:13:22.898 --> 01:13:27.898
then I will use you as an example for the whole world.

412
01:13:27.898 --> 01:13:29.898
That is the covenant with Abraham.

413
01:13:29.898 --> 01:13:33.898
I will be good to you and I will be so good to you...

414
01:13:33.898 --> 01:13:35.898
I will boast with you.

415
01:13:35.898 --> 01:13:38.898
I will brag with you in the world.

416
01:13:38.898 --> 01:13:42.898
And I will be so good to you because I will make you an example.

417
01:13:42.898 --> 01:13:46.898
For the covenant and the prophecy that God speaks over Abraham is...

418
01:13:46.898 --> 01:13:49.898
through you I will be good to the whole world.

419
01:13:49.898 --> 01:13:52.898
That is the essence of Israel.

420
01:13:52.898 --> 01:13:57.898
He says to Abraham, through you the whole world will be blessed.

421
01:13:57.898 --> 01:13:59.898
That's what it's all about.

422
01:13:59.898 --> 01:14:04.898
So the question is, does God love Abraham much more...

423
01:14:04.898 --> 01:14:06.898
is not a question that is necessary.

424
01:14:06.898 --> 01:14:12.898
The Bible proves that for God so loved the whole world...

425
01:14:13.898 --> 01:14:18.898
that everyone who believes in Jesus will not perish but has eternal life.

426
01:14:18.898 --> 01:14:20.898
So God loves the whole world.

427
01:14:20.898 --> 01:14:23.898
So we don't need to tire ourselves with a debate...

428
01:14:23.898 --> 01:14:26.898
about whether God loves Israel more than the other nations.

429
01:14:26.898 --> 01:14:29.898
That is not the essence of the story of the Bible.

430
01:14:29.898 --> 01:14:37.898
The essence is that God uses Israel as an example to bless the whole world.

431
01:14:38.898 --> 01:14:42.898
And in the Old Testament, he invites Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob...

432
01:14:42.898 --> 01:14:46.898
to begin a father-son relationship.

433
01:14:46.898 --> 01:14:48.898
And he blesses them.

434
01:14:48.898 --> 01:14:51.898
And everyone who says to you I will bless, says God.

435
01:14:51.898 --> 01:14:55.898
And everyone who wants to do you harm I will take care of, says God.

436
01:14:55.898 --> 01:14:57.898
And I will bless you.

437
01:14:57.898 --> 01:14:59.898
And I will give you a land.

438
01:14:59.898 --> 01:15:01.898
I will give you a promised land...

439
01:15:01.898 --> 01:15:03.898
I promise you a land, says God.

440
01:15:03.898 --> 01:15:05.898
And all of this has happened.

441
01:15:05.898 --> 01:15:08.898
And everything we read there in the Old Testament...

442
01:15:08.898 --> 01:15:13.898
are all physical examples of actual spiritual realities.

443
01:15:13.898 --> 01:15:15.898
God says to Abraham...

444
01:15:15.898 --> 01:15:17.898
among all those other nations...

445
01:15:17.898 --> 01:15:20.898
for now we are coming a bit to Ezekiel 16...

446
01:15:20.898 --> 01:15:22.898
and also to Ezra chapter 9.

447
01:15:22.898 --> 01:15:25.898
Among all those other nations that are all fumbling around...

448
01:15:25.898 --> 01:15:28.898
and all want nothing to do with the Creator...

449
01:15:28.898 --> 01:15:30.898
but are all pursuing creations.

450
01:15:30.898 --> 01:15:33.898
We will worship the sun and we will worship a tree.

451
01:15:34.898 --> 01:15:37.898
And among all that idolatry...

452
01:15:37.898 --> 01:15:42.898
God tells Abraham a true story...

453
01:15:42.898 --> 01:15:44.898
so a physical example.

454
01:15:44.898 --> 01:15:47.898
Notice what a true physical example is...

455
01:15:47.898 --> 01:15:49.898
of a spiritual reality.

456
01:15:49.898 --> 01:15:55.898
Abraham, offer me your son.

457
01:15:55.898 --> 01:15:57.898
Surrender.

458
01:15:57.898 --> 01:15:59.898
Kill for me.

459
01:15:59.898 --> 01:16:02.898
That really happened.

460
01:16:03.898 --> 01:16:07.898
And Abraham physically takes, as we read in the Bible...

461
01:16:07.898 --> 01:16:10.898
Abraham physically takes Isaac with him...

462
01:16:10.898 --> 01:16:12.898
the promised son, the beloved son.

463
01:16:12.898 --> 01:16:14.898
He physically takes him with him.

464
01:16:14.898 --> 01:16:16.898
He takes wood with him.

465
01:16:16.898 --> 01:16:18.898
He takes fire with him.

466
01:16:18.898 --> 01:16:20.898
He takes a sword with him.

467
01:16:20.898 --> 01:16:23.898
Isaac still asks, where is the lamb actually?

468
01:16:23.898 --> 01:16:25.898
Physically happened.

469
01:16:25.898 --> 01:16:27.898
Abraham turns around and he says...

470
01:16:27.898 --> 01:16:29.898
God will provide a lamb.

471
01:16:29.898 --> 01:16:31.898
And they arrive.

472
01:16:31.898 --> 01:16:34.898
And at the moment that Abraham wants to kill his son...

473
01:16:34.898 --> 01:16:37.898
God says, stop.

474
01:16:37.898 --> 01:16:41.898
I am not like all those other gods...

475
01:16:41.898 --> 01:16:43.898
