476
01:16:43.898 --> 01:16:45.898
I will provide.

477
01:16:45.898 --> 01:16:47.898
You do not need to provide.

478
01:16:47.898 --> 01:16:49.898
I will provide.

479
01:16:49.898 --> 01:16:51.898
I am the true good God.

480
01:16:51.898 --> 01:16:54.898
And here we have a true story...

481
01:16:54.898 --> 01:16:58.898
where a spiritual reality comes to earth.

482
01:16:58.898 --> 01:17:00.898
God expresses Himself...

483
01:17:00.898 --> 01:17:02.898
not as a demanding God, dear church.

484
01:17:02.898 --> 01:17:05.898
God expresses Himself as a providing God.

485
01:17:05.898 --> 01:17:07.898
As a restoring God.

486
01:17:07.898 --> 01:17:09.898
And so we see time and again...

487
01:17:09.898 --> 01:17:11.898
all kinds of these wonderful examples...

488
01:17:11.898 --> 01:17:13.898
from which we can learn...

489
01:17:13.898 --> 01:17:15.898
that from the physical truths...

490
01:17:15.898 --> 01:17:18.898
spiritual realities emerge.

491
01:17:20.898 --> 01:17:22.898
Now we read Ezra chapter 9 all at once.

492
01:17:22.898 --> 01:17:25.898
We have gone through Ezra over the past few weeks.

493
01:17:25.898 --> 01:17:27.898
We see provisions.

494
01:17:28.898 --> 01:17:30.898
And God starts anew again.

495
01:17:30.898 --> 01:17:32.898
Yes, yes, God starts again.

496
01:17:32.898 --> 01:17:34.898
I made a mess of things, but then I got baptized.

497
01:17:34.898 --> 01:17:37.898
And now everything is hunky-dory. Everything is great.

498
01:17:38.898 --> 01:17:40.898
Now we come to Ezra chapter 9.

499
01:17:40.898 --> 01:17:42.898
Who has read Ezra chapter 9?

500
01:17:42.898 --> 01:17:44.898
I will unpack a few for you.

501
01:17:44.898 --> 01:17:46.898
Ezra chapter 9.

502
01:17:46.898 --> 01:17:48.898
So we have had restoration.

503
01:17:48.898 --> 01:17:50.898
We have read provisions.

504
01:17:50.898 --> 01:17:52.898
Then at one point we read...

505
01:17:52.898 --> 01:17:54.898
