506
01:17:54.898 --> 01:17:56.898
And that we must stand strong in our faith in God.

507
01:17:56.898 --> 01:18:00.898
And that despite opposition, God continues with His plan. Amen.

508
01:18:00.898 --> 01:18:03.898
And now we come to Ezra chapter 9.

509
01:18:03.898 --> 01:18:05.898
And it says in verse 1...

510
01:18:05.898 --> 01:18:08.898
I will take a few out to save time.

511
01:18:08.898 --> 01:18:10.898
