1314
01:51:48.898 --> 01:51:50.898
...in the name of Jesus...

1315
01:51:50.898 --> 01:51:52.898
...but the world also gladly calls you back.

1316
01:51:54.898 --> 01:51:56.898
For the Bible says...

1317
01:51:56.898 --> 01:51:58.898
...that the devil prowls around like a roaring lion...

1318
01:51:58.898 --> 01:52:00.898
...looking for someone to devour, steal, and kill.

1319
01:52:02.898 --> 01:52:04.898
And here is my question...

1320
01:52:04.898 --> 01:52:06.898
...for self-reflection, while you have your eyes closed.

1321
01:52:08.898 --> 01:52:10.898
What things must I do...

1322
01:52:10.898 --> 01:52:12.898
