1323
01:52:12.898 --> 01:52:14.898
To be able to remain in His presence?

1324
01:52:16.898 --> 01:52:18.898
What things must I still banish from my life?

1325
01:52:20.898 --> 01:52:22.898
What things then in the presence...

1326
01:52:22.898 --> 01:52:24.898
...of old friend groups...

1327
01:52:24.898 --> 01:52:26.898
...or old colleague groups...

1328
01:52:26.898 --> 01:52:28.898
...that actually want to pull you back...

1329
01:52:28.898 --> 01:52:30.898
