1330
01:52:30.898 --> 01:52:32.898
Or sins from the past...

1331
01:52:32.898 --> 01:52:34.898
...that actually want to walk with you?

1332
01:52:34.898 --> 01:52:36.898
Like pornography, for example.

1333
01:52:36.898 --> 01:52:38.898
Often, there are no friends involved.

1334
01:52:38.898 --> 01:52:40.898
That is your personal sin.

1335
01:52:40.898 --> 01:52:42.898
What must I banish from my life?

1336
01:52:42.898 --> 01:52:44.898
God is the God of restoration.

1337
01:52:46.898 --> 01:52:48.898
I want to conclude this service...

1338
01:52:48.898 --> 01:52:50.898
...with these beautiful words.

1339
01:52:50.898 --> 01:52:52.898
Not with the weighty, painful words...

1340
01:52:52.898 --> 01:52:54.898
