1341
01:52:54.898 --> 01:52:56.898
But I want to end with these words.

1342
01:52:56.898 --> 01:52:58.898
God is the God of restoration.

1343
01:52:58.898 --> 01:53:00.898
While you have your eyes closed.

1344
01:53:00.898 --> 01:53:02.898
What things are you going to...

1345
01:53:02.898 --> 01:53:04.898
