1354
01:53:20.898 --> 01:53:22.898
The Lord is a God of restoration.

1355
01:53:22.898 --> 01:53:24.898
He forgives us our sins.

1356
01:53:24.898 --> 01:53:26.898
Time and time again.

1357
01:53:26.898 --> 01:53:28.898
Maybe we need to say sorry...

1358
01:53:28.898 --> 01:53:30.898
...for a number of things...

1359
01:53:30.898 --> 01:53:32.898
...that we have done wrong again...

1360
01:53:32.898 --> 01:53:34.898
...while we knew we shouldn't have done it.

1361
01:53:34.898 --> 01:53:36.898
We have a God of restoration.

1362
01:53:36.898 --> 01:53:38.898
Time and time again.

1363
01:53:39.898 --> 01:53:41.898
Lastly, I want to pray this.

1364
01:53:41.898 --> 01:53:43.898
While you have your eyes closed.

1365
01:53:43.898 --> 01:53:45.898
Holy Spirit, fill our hearts.

1366
01:53:46.898 --> 01:53:48.898
Fill us with your Holy Spirit...

1367
01:53:49.898 --> 01:53:51.898
...so that we may stand strong...

1368
01:53:51.898 --> 01:53:53.898
...in this world.

1369
01:53:53.898 --> 01:53:55.898
