1377
01:54:11.898 --> 01:54:13.898
Strength through the Holy Spirit...

1378
01:54:13.898 --> 01:54:15.898
...to be able to say no...

1379
01:54:15.898 --> 01:54:17.898
...to the traps of Satan.

1380
01:54:18.898 --> 01:54:21.898
Lord, give us that resurrection power...

1381
01:54:21.898 --> 01:54:23.898
