1397
01:55:05.898 --> 01:55:08.898
...radiant for Jesus.

1398
01:55:08.898 --> 01:55:12.898
So you are completely pure...

1399
01:55:12.898 --> 01:55:14.898
...in the name of King Jesus.

1400
